  "description": "Netflix, Nintendo, Amazon secrets.  \nRemember Blockbuster? Netflix sure does. Although once a formidable rival, Netflix is now one of the leading companies of the century. Like this, so many of the brands we know and love each have their own story of success. Explained through short and fun comics, Behind the Logo illustrates how companies like Netflix and Nintendo became legends.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://ridibooks.com/books/3120000263)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://manta.net/series/1219)",
